{"seq":4,"slug":"biology","title":"生物","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology","introMarkdown":"# 生物 简介\n\n大学生物学从分子和细胞的微观层面出发，经由个体发育和生理功能的中间尺度，延伸到种群、群落和生态系统的宏观视野，构建了对生命现象从还原到整合的多层次理解。DNA双螺旋的发现、基因组测序的完成和CRISPR基因编辑技术的诞生标志着生物学已经从一门描述性学科转变为一门具有强大预测和干预能力的定量科学。\n\n自学者进入大学生物学时会发现它与高中生物有质的区别。高中侧重记忆生物学事实——细胞的结构名称、遗传的基本定律、光合作用的产物；大学则要求理解这些现象背后的分子机制和进化逻辑。为什么线粒体拥有自己的DNA？为什么几乎所有生物共用同一套遗传密码？这些\"为什么\"问题的答案往往连接着生命科学最深层的理论框架。\n\n第一章**细胞与分子生物学**从细胞结构和功能出发，深入到基因的分子机制，是理解所有生命现象的基础。第二章**个体生物学**关注动物生理学、植物生物学和发育生物学，探讨从受精卵到复杂有机体的构建过程。第三章**生态与进化**将视角从个体扩展到种群和生态系统，以进化论为统一框架理解生物多样性的起源和维持。第四章**生物技术**介绍基因工程、生物信息学和合成生物学等前沿技术方向。\n\n建议在学习时始终记住进化生物学家杜布赞斯基的名言：\"生物学中的一切只有在进化的光照下才有意义。\"将进化思维作为贯穿整个学习过程的主线，能够将看似分散的生物学知识连接成一个有机整体。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-molecular","title":"细胞与分子生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"cell-biology","title":"细胞生物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular/cell-biology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"molecular-biology","title":"分子生物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular/molecular-biology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"biochemistry","title":"生物化学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/cell-molecular/biochemistry"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"organismal-biology","title":"个体生物学","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/organismal-biology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"genetics","title":"遗传学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/organismal-biology/genetics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"plant-biology","title":"植物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/organismal-biology/plant-biology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"animal-physiology","title":"动物生理学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/organismal-biology/animal-physiology"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"ecology-evolution","title":"生态与进化","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/ecology-evolution","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"ecology","title":"生态学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/ecology-evolution/ecology"},{"seq":2,"slug":"evolutionary-biology","title":"进化生物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/ecology-evolution/evolutionary-biology"},{"seq":3,"slug":"conservation-biology","title":"保护生物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/ecology-evolution/conservation-biology"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"biotechnology","title":"生物技术","docCount":3,"url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/biotechnology","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"genetic-engineering","title":"基因工程","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/biotechnology/genetic-engineering"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bioinformatics","title":"生物信息学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/biotechnology/bioinformatics"},{"seq":3,"slug":"synthetic-biology","title":"合成生物学","url":"/education/university/natural-sciences/biology/biotechnology/synthetic-biology"}]}]}